  "body": {
    "storage": {
      "value": "<p><span>Hi all，</span><br /><span>【元宵喜乐会】活动即将进入测试阶段，现申请相关资源、</span><span>礼物配置。</span><br /><br />辛苦@玉松 审批，<br />辛苦@灿灿 配置。</p><p style=\"\">1、资源申请</p><table><colgroup class=\"\"><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 48.0pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 104.0pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 48.0pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 368.0pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 48.0pt;\" /> </colgroup><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td>类型</td><td>资源名称</td><td>id</td><td>url</td><td>备注</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>麦序框</td><td>喜迎元宵麦序框</td><td>6551</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTczODkxOTc5NTUwMiM1NzYjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTczODkxOTc5NTUwMiM1NzYjcG5n.png</a></td><td>改名字</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>发言波纹</td><td>喜迎元宵发言波纹</td><td>4806</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTcwNzEyNDYyMTIxMCMxMDMjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTcwNzEyNDYyMTIxMCMxMDMjcG5n.png</a></td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>上麦动效</td><td>喜迎元宵上麦动效</td><td>9236</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTY3MzgzNjk0MDU1NCM0NzgjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTY3MzgzNjk0MDU1NCM0NzgjcG5n.png</a></td><td>改名字</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>头像框</td><td>喜迎元宵头像框</td><td>6548</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTczODkxOTU1MDgyMyMgODkjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTczODkxOTU1MDgyMyMgODkjcG5n.png</a></td><td>改名字</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>公聊角标</td><td>喜气元宵公聊角标</td><td>4824</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTcwODMxMjIxMjY1NiM0ODEjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTcwODMxMjIxMjY1NiM0ODEjcG5n.png</a></td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>公聊皮肤</td><td>喜迎元宵公聊皮肤</td><td>4823</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTcwODMxMjA5ODgxNiMgOTIjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTcwODMxMjA5ODgxNiMgOTIjcG5n.png</a></td><td>改名字</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>主页挂件</td><td>喜迎元宵主页挂件</td><td>7930</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc1MDY2ODM0NjA0OCMxMzYjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc1MDY2ODM0NjA0OCMxMzYjcG5n.png</a></td><td>改名字</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>主页浮屏</td><td>喜迎元宵主页浮屏</td><td>2685</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTY0MjY0NzA5NDg1MyM5ODEjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTY0MjY0NzA5NDg1MyM5ODEjcG5n.png</a></td><td>改名字</td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\">2、礼物申请</p><table><colgroup class=\"\"><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 95.25pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 48.0pt;\" /> </colgroup><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td>礼物名称</td><td>钻石数</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>黑芝麻元宵</td><td>10</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>指尖星光</td><td>99</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>爱意定格</td><td>520</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>时光恋人</td><td>1314</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>凤凰之约</td><td>5200</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>窈窕佳人</td><td>13140</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>西施之美</td><td>52000</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>时代传奇</td><td>99999</td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\">以上，如有问题及时沟通～</p><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p>",
